e. providing knowledge about prevention and mechanisms for handling violence against women and children; and f. enhancing the role and value of local wisdom and the role of custom in the protection of women and children. Prevention as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be implemented in an integrated manner by Regional Apparatus that (2) have main duties and functions in the fields of: empowerment of women and protection of children; education;

health;

social affairs and manpower;

youth and sports; and
f. mental and spiritual.

